{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV港版《悠長假期》第三集製作特輯正式曝光，男主角Edan（呂爵安）挑戰演繹迷惘鋼琴家「Marty」，未 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV港版《悠長假期》第三集製作特輯正式曝光，男主角Edan（呂爵安）挑戰演繹迷惘鋼琴家「Marty」，未播出前已引起大量關注！面對木村拓哉經典演出，他坦言接拍時大感震驚，深知比較在所難免，早在收到劇本之後，就知道要調整心態。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501680780885911_4601493176afdc86a1310a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1e28f8db-f249-4d8e-ba75-2b3ba50a1aac.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501680780885911_4601493176afdc86a1310a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan強調今次劇本到手，就很清晰今次任務不是複製木村，而是由角色出發。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>Edan獲悉接拍港版《悠長假期》過程極具戲劇性</h2>\n<p>Edan在第3集製作特輯中現身受訪，親自剖白接拍這套神劇翻拍版背後故事。他笑言整個過程十分突然，當時正值拍攝廣告期間，經理人花姐無預警詢問是否有興趣接拍公司新劇。當他追問是哪一套作品並得知是《悠長假期》時，當場嚇了一跳並驚訝反問：「劇名咁熟嘅？！木村嗰套呀？」在得到確認後，他直言當時完全反應不過來，但最終依然決定迎接這項巨大挑戰。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681462825310_19951331216afdc86f02881.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"dd63d80f-7042-44b1-b22c-4af446c931b0.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681462825310_19951331216afdc86f02881.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>製作特輯中流出一段Edan扮醉的幕後花絮。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>期望撇除木村拓哉影子 專注演活「迷惘感」</h2>\n<p>重新演繹木村拓哉曾經塑造過無數人心目中完美形象，Edan深知外界必定會將兩人作比較。他在特輯中強調自己會盡力做好本份，並直言「我係演緊一個『迷惘嘅年輕人』，而唔係演緊『木村拓哉』」。</p>\n<h2>Edan自覺與角色Marty有相似之處</h2>\n<p>他透露主角Marty夢想成為鋼琴家，性格上與自己同樣屬於「準備充足才行動」類型。他期望透過專注演活角色內心迷惘，讓觀眾放下對他過往搞笑形象既定認知，展現出截然不同專業面貌。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681634416725_9635519046afdc870a4639.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"79b7a68d-46d9-420b-94ee-e4acbb468538.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681634416725_9635519046afdc870a4639.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>導演團隊改編三十周年經典神劇注入新元素</h2>\n<p>適逢富士電視台的《悠長假期》原著劇集迎來30周年，導演楊承恩向金廣誠提出改編想法，希望將劇集精神內核再次傳遞給現今面對生活難題觀眾。另一位導演李紹波則認為，這不僅僅是一個愛情故事，更是一個用愛情包裝心靈慰藉旅程。幕後團隊認為將經典作改編絕不容易，在加入香港本土新元素同時亦必須保留原著韻味，期望藉著這個契機為處於人生迷惘期年輕人帶來共鳴與啟發。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681792521435_5542056556afdc87269699.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b7b5a7f9-7751-4f60-bd84-697a6bec8200.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501681792521435_5542056556afdc87269699.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>編劇黃綺琳坦言最初與網民同感憂慮破壞經典</h2>\n<p>翻拍神劇消息傳出後，網上隨即湧現各種兩極評論，不少網民留言直呼「唔好搞啦，唔好破壞經典」。編劇黃綺琳在特輯中大爆，當初聽到導演提出改編要求時，自己內心第一反應其實與所有網民完全一樣，同樣充滿憂慮。隨著製作特輯陸續公開，網民開始留意到Edan為角色注入全新生命力，以及導演團隊強調「因為你相信，先至會發生」拍攝理念，網絡輿論亦開始聚焦於港版如何重新詮釋這份心靈慰藉。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157514666199_10424509016afdb3f775320.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157514666199_10424509016afdb3f775320.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157691960958_6081691356afdb3f95faa2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157691960958_6081691356afdb3f95faa2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157332637651_8968518826afdb3f5b09c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501157332637651_8968518826afdb3f5b09c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p></p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%82%e7%88%b5%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">呂爵安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%8a%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港劇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3545582\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.855603+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1440,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:45:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:37:34.181772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:34.470615+00:00","content_hash":"cd38f92dc8ec1913b046b6ad9d37a366117fde6d97b590b1523c0473181363c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}